  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multilateral Development Banks (MDB&apos;s) Transport data - research</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ieConnect programme funds the Development Impact Evaluation group at the World Bank to conduct impact evaluations on the role of transport infrastructure in economic development. The programme aims to achieve impact by improving the selection, design, and implementation of transport infrastructure projects in FCDO-focus countries and beyond. This would help re-prioritise transport investments to connect remote areas to the global economy, create new trade corridors, empower women and children and to permit the development of bigger, denser, more productive and cleaner cities.</narrative>
  </description>
